    "label": "41",
    "prompt": "List the elements of the following set.\n$$\\{2n+1\\text{ where }n\\in\\mathbb Z\\text{ and }0\\le n\\le3\\}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\{1,3,5,7\\}$",
      "worked": "The allowed values are $n=0,1,2,3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2(0)+1&=1\\\\2(1)+1&=3\\\\2(2)+1&=5\\\\2(3)+1&=7\\end{align*}$$\nThe set is $\\{1,3,5,7\\}$.",
